0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#one-binary-five-decisions","title":"One binary, five decisions"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-crate-graph","title":"The crate graph"},{"depth":2,"url":"#configuration-is-json5-and-it-is-validated-early","title":"Configuration is JSON5, and it is validated early"},{"depth":2,"url":"#stores-are-built-in-two-phases","title":"Stores are built in two phases"},{"depth":2,"url":"#services-come-up-in-a-fixed-order","title":"Services come up in a fixed order"},{"depth":2,"url":"#where-an-actions-path-forks","title":"Where an action's path forks"},{"depth":3,"url":"#the-pre-flight-check-is-deliberately-racy","title":"The pre-flight check is deliberately racy"},{"depth":2,"url":"#two-details-that-surprise-people-reading-the-wire","title":"Two details that surprise people reading the wire"},{"depth":2,"url":"#common-questions","title":"Common questions"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"Architecture deep dive"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"The crate graph, the startup sequence, and the path an action actually takes through the binary."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," anyone about to read, extend or debug the Forge\nsource, and anyone who needs to predict what the binary does rather than\nwhat the protocol says it should. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll have at the end:"}]," the crate\ngraph, the order things come up in at startup, and where an action's path\nforks. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," fifteen minutes."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/explanations/architecture","children":"Architecture"}]," describes four roles (CAS,\naction cache, scheduler, worker) because that is the shape of the ",["$","em",null,{"children":"protocol"}],".\nThis page describes the shape of the ",["$","em",null,{"children":"program"}],". They are not the same shape,\nand the difference is where most surprises live: there is one binary, the\nroles are configuration, and two of the four never talk to each other in\nprocess at all."]}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"one-binary-five-decisions","children":"One binary, five decisions"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"forge"}]," is a single executable. Which roles it plays is decided entirely\nby the config file it is handed; there are no build features to toggle and\nno separate images per role. Everything below happens inside\n",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/toxicwind/forge/blob/v1.6.5/src/bin/forge.rs","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","data-source-link":"src/bin/forge.rs","data-source-ref":"v1.6.5","title":"src/bin/forge.rs at v1.6.5","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground no-underline transition-colors hover:border-brand/50 hover:text-brand","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"12","height":"12","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"}]}],"src/bin/forge.rs"]}],"."]}],"\n",["$","$L8",null,{"children":"graph TD\ncfg[\"Parse JSON5 config\"] --> stores[\"Build every store<br/>store_factory + post_init\"]\nstores --> sched[\"Build every scheduler<br/>scheduler_factory\"]\nsched --> svc[\"Register gRPC services<br/>in fixed order\"]\nsvc --> listen[\"Bind listeners\"]\nlisten --> workers[\"Start local workers\"]\nworkers --> run[\"Run forever<br/>(any root future failing = panic)\"]\n"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The ordering is not incidental. Stores are constructed before schedulers\nbecause schedulers hold store handles; schedulers are constructed before\nservices because the execution service holds a scheduler handle; and workers\nare started ","$L9"," the listeners are bound, deliberately, so that a worker\nin the same process cannot begin announcing itself before the server it\nwould announce to can answer."]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a"]}],"$L2b"]}],["$L2c","$L2d"],"$L2e"]}],"isPartial":"$@2f","staleTime":"$30","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L31","isPartial":"$@32","staleTime":"$30","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L33","isPartial":"$@34","staleTime":"$30","varyParams":"$35"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@36","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@37"}
